          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.77,
          "end": 94.863,
          "en": "And in there, we can create a new class, AnswerButton,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.66,
          "end": 98.52000000000001,
          "en": "and here, since I want to build a widget,",
