        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 177.24,
          "end": 180.27,
          "en": "It should not be locked into this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.27,
          "end": 183.3,
          "en": "And of course, you might already know how this works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.3,
          "end": 186.51,
          "en": "because you learned how to make your widgets configurable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.51,
          "end": 188.88,
          "en": "in the previous core section as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.88,
          "end": 193.503,
          "en": "We can add a constructor function here, answer button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 199.53,
          "en": "and a property, in this case, the answer text for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 199.53,
          "end": 200.943,
          "en": "which should be a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.68,
          "end": 205.11,
          "en": "and then here in this constructor function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.11,
          "end": 209.343,
          "en": "we can accept and set the answer text argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 210.51,
          "end": 214.35,
          "en": "and also accept and forward that key argument here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 214.35,
          "end": 218.52,
          "en": "this named key argument, and then we can use answer text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 218.52,
          "end": 219.87,
          "en": "which we get as an argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 219.87,
          "end": 222.48,
          "en": "and which we store in this class variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.48,
          "end": 225.36,
          "en": "down there as a value for this text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 225.36,
          "end": 229.353,
          "en": "so that this text is actually set from outside this widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 230.64,
          "end": 233.37,
